==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Butterfree|3}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Generations|Butterfree|5}} from the {{TCG|Generations}} expansion.
**Both this card and the Generations print have the {{m|Gust}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Butterfree}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

